    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;Highlights&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;574 PRs from 169 contributors.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DSpark: confidence-driven speculative decoding&lt;/strong&gt;: A new speculative algorithm. It drafts semi-autoregressively in blocks, then sizes each verify window from the draft's own confidence instead of a fixed draft length. Reaches &lt;strong&gt;383.7 tok/s at accept length ~5&lt;/strong&gt; on DeepSeek-V4-Pro, TP8 on B300 (bs=1). E</ns0:content>
